@page "/"

<PageTitle>GrowDate</PageTitle>

<div class="home-container">
    <p class="kicker">The planter’s companion</p>
    <h1 class="display">Plant in season, wherever you grow.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Pick a region, open the calendar, and see which crops want the soil now.</p>
    <a href="select-region" class="btn">Choose your region</a>

    <div class="feature-cards">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Region</h3>
            <p>Six climates, from California valleys to São Paulo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Calendar</h3>
            <p>Days marked when something can go in the ground.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Crops</h3>
            <p>Ideal, coming soon, late, or wait until next season.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Select your region</strong> on the map or from the list.</li>
            <li><strong>Pick a date</strong> in the calendar.</li>
            <li><strong>Read the window</strong> — ideal, coming soon, late, or out of season.</li>
            <li><strong>Plant</strong> using the germination and harvest estimates.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</div>
